### ============================================================================
### Car Wash ERP & POS API - HTTP Requests Collection
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Root API Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### ============================================================================
### Dashboard Analytics
### ============================================================================

### Get Dashboard Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/stats

### ============================================================================
### Inventory Management (المخزون بالجرام)
### ============================================================================

### Get All Inventory Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory

### Get Low Stock Items Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory?lowStock=true

### Create New Inventory Item (Raw Material in Grams)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "شامبو حماية متقدم بلس",
  "unit": "gram",
  "current_stock_grams": 80000,
  "reorder_threshold_grams": 8000,
  "cost_per_gram": 0.020,
  "notes": "توريد جديد برميل 80 كجم"
}

### Restock Inventory Item (Add Grams)
# Replace {itemId} with actual UUID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/restock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "grams": 25000,
  "costPerGram": 0.015
}

### ============================================================================
### Services & BOM Recipes (الخدمات ووصفات الجرامات)
### ============================================================================

### Get All Active Services with Recipes & Material Costs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services?status=active

### Get Single Service by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services/b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003

### Create New Wash Service with BOM Recipes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "غسيل بخار ملكي داخلي وخارجي",
  "price": 180.00,
  "description": "غسيل بالبخار الحار مع تنظيف الفرش والتعقيم بالأوزون",
  "category": "VIP بخار",
  "status": "active",
  "recipes": [
    {
      "inventory_item_id": "a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "quantity_grams": 150.00,
      "notes": "صابون رغوي للبخار"
    },
    {
      "inventory_item_id": "a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "quantity_grams": 40.00,
      "notes": "تعطير مكثف"
    }
  ]
}

### Update Service Recipes (BOM)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/services/b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipes": [
    {
      "inventory_item_id": "a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "quantity_grams": 130.00,
      "notes": "زيادة رغوة الصابون"
    },
    {
      "inventory_item_id": "a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "quantity_grams": 35.00,
      "notes": "تلميع الكفرات"
    }
  ]
}

### ============================================================================
### POS & Orders (نقاط البيع والخصم الذري للمخزون)
### ============================================================================

### Create New POS Order (Deducts Grams from Inventory Atomically)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pos/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service_id": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "car_plate": "ر ق م 4321",
  "car_type": "SUV - يوكن",
  "customer_name": "مشعل الحربي",
  "customer_phone": "0555554433",
  "payment_method": "card",
  "assigned_employee_id": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "notes": "غسيل سريع مع التركيز على تلميع الجنوط"
}

### Get Recent POS Orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pos/orders?limit=20

### Get Single Order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pos/orders/d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### ============================================================================
### HR & Real-time Payroll (الموظفين، الحضور، والحساب اللحظي)
### ============================================================================

### Get All Active Employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/employees?status=active

### Record Attendance (Check-in & Check-out with Auto Overtime/Deduction Calculation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/attendance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "work_date": "2026-08-18",
  "check_in": "2026-08-18T08:00:00Z",
  "check_out": "2026-08-18T17:30:00Z",
  "notes": "حضور منتظم + ساعة ونصف إضافي"
}

### Get Attendance Records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/attendance

### Create Financial Transaction for Employee (Advance, Bonus, Deduction)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "type": "bonus",
  "amount": 120.00,
  "notes": "مكافأة إنجاز غسيل VIP في وقت قياسي"
}

### Create Advance (سلفة)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "type": "advance",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "notes": "سلفة مصاريف طارئة"
}

### Calculate Real-Time Payroll Preview for Employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/payroll/calculate/c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Settle and Payout Payroll (Creates Payout Record & Settles Transactions Atomically)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/payroll/payout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_id": "c0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "period_start": "2026-08-01",
  "period_end": "2026-08-31",
  "payment_method": "transfer",
  "notes": "صرف راتب شهر أغسطس 2026 عبر تحويل بنكي"
}

### Get Payout History Archive
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hr/payroll/payouts
